# __PROJECT_TITLE__

FastAPI backend on Cloud Run + Windmill raw_app frontend, scaffolded via the hallo theo `new-app` skill.

## Local dev

```bash
make install   # uv sync + npm install
cp .env.example .env.general && $EDITOR .env.general   # fill in FRONTEND_SERVICE_SECRET
make dev       # FastAPI :8000 + Vite :5173
```

Open http://localhost:5173.

## Deployment

CI/CD is wired via `hallo-theo/.github`:
- PR opened → `pr.yml` runs lint + typecheck + tests + docker build sanity
- Merged to main → `main.yml` builds + deploys to Cloud Run + pushes raw_app to Windmill

For the deploy workflow to succeed, the following must exist:
- WIF provider + deploy SA in `__GCP_PROJECT__` (the `new-app` skill creates these)
- `WMILL_TOKEN` org-level GitHub secret (the `new-app` skill sets this)
- The Cloud Run service `__CLOUD_RUN_SERVICE__` must already exist — the deploy SA has `roles/run.developer` which can *update* services but not create them. First-time setup: `gcloud run deploy __CLOUD_RUN_SERVICE__ --image=<some-bootstrap-image> --region=__GCP_REGION__ --project=__GCP_PROJECT__` once. After that, CI handles it.

## What this template doesn't include

Kept intentionally minimum:

- **No Postgres / DB scaffolding.** Add `psycopg` + a `db.py` + `migrations/` + `docker-compose.yml` if you need persistence. See `hallo-theo/object-details` for the canonical pattern.
- **No CRUD endpoints, audit log, exports, PDF generation.** Those are object-details patterns — copy them when needed.
- **No terraform.** Add per-app once you know what infra you actually need.

## Reference patterns

When you need something this template doesn't include:

| Pattern | Reference |
|---|---|
| Postgres + migrations + dev modes | [`hallo-theo/object-details`](https://github.com/hallo-theo/object-details) |
| Audit log / event sourcing | object-details `endpoints/events.py` |
| Excel export via openpyxl | object-details `endpoints/exports.py` |
| ReportLab PDF generation | object-details `services/pdf_generator.py` |
| Multi-section accordion UI | object-details `components/ObjectDetailPage.tsx` |
| Terraform: Cloud SQL + VPC + Cloud Run | object-details `terraform/` |
